    ['shop', '商铺底层', [3.2, 3, 6], 'One ground-floor bay of a contemporary Chinese urban village building. Concrete frame, weathered cream tile, open small shop on Z+ with recessed shutter and glass door, tiled rear wall. Width 3.2m along X, height 3m, depth 6m. Flat joining faces at X sides, no projecting side walls; adjacent bays form one building. Floor at local Y=0, open structural top at Y=3. Fixed Chinese grocery lettering above the entrance.'],
